recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the loom is landed and Mantra's arc is re-cut, so the next lane lap is the weave's MERGE and its order-independence proof. Worth your word first: the arc as published booked three rounds for work that stands, so I would rather you confirm the re-cut before I spend the next three on merge.
